 "analysis": "paired two-level bootstrap (v3/e/analyze_v3.boot_diff: resample training seeds within each group, the SAME resampled days for both groups), 4000 resamples, 95 % percentile CIs; Holm correction over the primary return comparisons; constraint = lower CI bound of the paired difference vs the reference above minus the margin; safety violations counted exactly (must be 0).",
